      "note": "This is a shortened actual pilot example.\nTwo gains escaped repetition; one\ncorrected a final answer. One answer\nregressed into repetition. We did not\nexecute any model-written code. For RLMs,\ndistinguish finishing reliably from\nlearning useful decomposition."
